  autoDescription: 1
  description: 'Heal 5% (Max 6%) of your max HP now and gain a Regeneration stack:
    at the start of each of your turns you heal 5% (Max 6%) of your max HP per stack
    (max 3 stacks = 15% (Max 18%) per turn). Each turn''s heal can fail: 10% with
    one stack, +10% for every extra stack (max 30%). A failed turn heals nothing
    and loses one stack. Mana cost: 100.'
